+*   **Strengths:** Provides a structured prior for Gaussian initialization, potentially leading to faster convergence or better quality than random initialization [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Limitations:** Requires training a separate neural network (SF-VAE) before the main Gaussian Splatting optimization [S1, unofficial].
